      "content": "I understand how heavy it feels when the constant noise of the world becomes overwhelming. You can create a temporary sanctuary of stillness by stepping outside for a few minutes where you can sit with your eyes closed and listen only to your own breathing. Remember that this quiet practice requires no effort and isn't about forcing the noise away, but simply allowing yourself to rest within it.",
