      "content": "That perspective reflects a deep exhaustion when all usual coping mechanisms seem to fail, though being absent is not the only path to peace. The desire to escape the feeling of being overwhelmed often points to a need for deeper, more secure support rather than just temporary fixes. Would you be open to exploring art, music, or nature, which can sometimes provide a sense of peace without requiring active effort from you?",
